WEBVTT

00:33.687 --> 00:36.962
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.437 --> 00:39.800
=Episode 10=

00:39.950 --> 00:42.512
(You Think Your Great Clans
Are That Great?)

00:43.040 --> 00:44.919
They are eyeing the glaze workshop.

00:45.560 --> 00:47.080
This is an open challenge.

00:47.480 --> 00:49.000
It's just the sale of a little glaze.

00:49.120 --> 00:50.240
Is it really that serious?

00:50.250 --> 00:52.599
If they wanted to handle regional sales,
they should have come to me.

00:52.599 --> 00:53.900
I would have just given it to them.

00:53.919 --> 00:55.759
But now they're using the clans' power.

00:55.800 --> 00:57.080
In the business world,

00:57.080 --> 00:59.600
I've always welcomed everyone
from all over the world.

00:59.760 --> 01:01.760
Whether we can strike
a deal is another story.

01:02.199 --> 01:03.239
But look at them.

01:03.839 --> 01:05.920
They bypassed me to
pressure the Clan Leader.

01:08.200 --> 01:09.640
They even want to teach me a lesson?

01:09.640 --> 01:10.320
Just them?

01:12.640 --> 01:13.440
They aren't worthy.

01:14.760 --> 01:16.280
Then, how about

01:16.439 --> 01:17.799
mentioning this to Her Highness?

01:17.799 --> 01:18.439
No need.

01:18.439 --> 01:19.119
Aunt,

01:19.520 --> 01:20.960
go to the Clan Leader's house now.

01:21.000 --> 01:22.159
Tell them I'm coming...

01:25.079 --> 01:26.560
I'll go to the Clan Leader's house.

01:26.759 --> 01:28.479
If a fight breaks out,

01:28.479 --> 01:29.759
it'll be the Clan Leader's
house getting trashed.

01:30.000 --> 01:31.200
I'll just pay for the damages.

01:32.479 --> 01:33.600
Don't be reckless.

01:34.039 --> 01:36.359
You have no idea how
powerful these great clans are.

01:36.679 --> 01:37.719
Aunt,

01:38.240 --> 01:39.359
I am a Lord.

01:39.359 --> 01:40.240
What is there to fear?

01:40.240 --> 01:41.640
Should I let them bully me?

01:44.479 --> 01:46.000
When you arrive tomorrow,

01:46.240 --> 01:47.519
don't go looking for trouble.

01:47.519 --> 01:49.079
Just listen to what they have to say.

01:49.519 --> 01:51.719
The connection between
these great clans is very tight.

01:52.159 --> 01:53.390
We can't afford to offend them.

01:53.680 --> 01:55.040
As long as they don't provoke me.

01:55.799 --> 01:58.200
Either way, I'm not someone
to be trifled with.

02:01.079 --> 02:01.879
You're here.

02:02.319 --> 02:03.000
Sit.

02:05.599 --> 02:06.599
Since everyone is here,

02:06.680 --> 02:08.760
let's speak openly.

02:09.040 --> 02:12.280
It was indeed a mistake
by a member of our Wei clan

02:12.760 --> 02:14.599
not to inform you in advance.

02:15.239 --> 02:15.920
However,

02:16.200 --> 02:17.680
now that Wei Hao is here,

02:17.680 --> 02:19.480
it means he is willing to talk.

02:20.079 --> 02:21.879
If you have any suggestions,

02:22.000 --> 02:23.159
feel free to speak up.

02:23.640 --> 02:24.879
This matter

02:25.079 --> 02:26.840
is actually a small thing.

02:27.480 --> 02:28.439
A small thing?

02:29.799 --> 02:30.680
Clan Leader Wei,

02:31.359 --> 02:33.640
do you know how much profit can be made

02:34.560 --> 02:36.040
by selling this glaze elsewhere?

02:37.640 --> 02:40.040
I really don't know.

02:40.120 --> 02:41.840
The glaze from the capital,

02:42.000 --> 02:43.190
when transported to the South,

02:43.319 --> 02:45.040
the price immediately
rises by 20 percent.

02:45.480 --> 02:46.599
Transport it to the North,

02:46.680 --> 02:47.719
and it's 30 percent.

02:47.719 --> 02:49.079
If it's taken to Wanzhou,

02:49.239 --> 02:50.640
the price doubles.

02:51.840 --> 02:52.840
Those Hu merchants

02:53.400 --> 02:55.120
take the glaze to the grasslands,

02:55.159 --> 02:57.000
and the profit is at least three times.

02:57.840 --> 02:58.159
Three...

02:58.159 --> 03:00.120
All of our clans have
caravans to the grasslands.

03:00.280 --> 03:01.719
Although we don't go often,

03:02.199 --> 03:04.039
we go at least once a year.

03:04.120 --> 03:07.159
If we were the ones
selling the glaze there,

03:08.599 --> 03:09.719
how massive

03:10.439 --> 03:12.319
would the profit be, you think?

03:12.759 --> 03:15.199
It's actually that profitable?

03:15.680 --> 03:16.280
Exactly.

03:16.919 --> 03:19.439
Wei Hao can produce 30,000 guan

03:19.960 --> 03:21.800
worth of glaze in a single kiln.

03:22.080 --> 03:24.960
If we take all of it to the grasslands,

03:25.280 --> 03:29.280
we could bring back
at least 120,000 guan.

03:32.719 --> 03:34.120
That much?

03:35.439 --> 03:36.319
Wei Hao,

03:36.400 --> 03:37.280
how much can we have

03:37.759 --> 03:40.159
of this batch?

03:40.280 --> 03:41.159
This batch?

03:41.360 --> 03:42.159
Yes.

03:42.400 --> 03:44.199
You finished two kilns yesterday,

03:44.199 --> 03:45.800
and there's another kiln tomorrow.

03:45.960 --> 03:46.919
Is that right?

03:47.560 --> 03:50.479
For this batch, I've already
promised the first four kilns

03:50.520 --> 03:51.960
to the Hu merchants.

03:52.600 --> 03:54.319
The fifth kiln is for
the local merchants.

03:54.520 --> 03:55.319
You can take

03:55.400 --> 03:56.199
the fifth kiln.

03:56.199 --> 03:59.240
You'd rather give it to
the Hu merchants than us?

04:01.000 --> 04:02.680
Well, it's first-come, first-served.

04:03.479 --> 04:04.439
All I can say is,

04:04.840 --> 04:06.879
as for selling in your clans' territory,

04:07.159 --> 04:08.439
I can grant you that.

04:08.520 --> 04:09.840
But this batch of goods

04:10.319 --> 04:12.159
is not included this time.

04:12.560 --> 04:13.759
(He's being so patient.)

04:13.800 --> 04:15.560
(It seems he took my words to heart.)

04:15.800 --> 04:16.800
No matter what,

04:17.400 --> 04:19.680
you must give us fifty
percent of this batch.

04:19.680 --> 04:21.319
Only then can this matter be settled.

04:22.000 --> 04:24.290
Otherwise, don't blame
the great clans for punishing you.

04:28.800 --> 04:30.240
All crap.

04:30.599 --> 04:31.680
Who do you think you are,

04:31.680 --> 04:32.439
punishing me?

04:32.439 --> 04:33.840
Who the heck are you to punish me?

04:34.159 --> 04:34.960
You...

04:35.400 --> 04:36.120
You...

04:36.120 --> 04:37.199
"You" what?

04:37.439 --> 04:38.319
Let me tell you,

04:38.360 --> 04:39.560
I only came to talk today

04:39.560 --> 04:40.960
out of respect for the Clan Leader.

04:41.000 --> 04:42.520
For the sake of
the great clans' interests,

04:42.520 --> 04:44.319
I've already yielded
several areas to you,

04:44.439 --> 04:46.159
yet you still want a 50 percent cut?

04:46.159 --> 04:47.840
What kind of thing are you?

04:47.840 --> 04:49.039
Do you believe that I...

04:49.039 --> 04:49.840
Clan Leader Wei.

04:50.280 --> 04:51.000
Hao...

04:51.000 --> 04:51.840
Aunt, don't stop me.

04:51.840 --> 04:52.960
Hao...

04:52.960 --> 04:54.199
- Don't be impulsive.
- What a joke.

04:54.199 --> 04:54.759
Sit down and talk.

04:54.759 --> 04:55.400
Fine, fine.

04:55.400 --> 04:56.080
Sit down.

04:58.360 --> 05:00.839
Well, he has a bit of
an impulsive personality.

05:00.839 --> 05:02.480
Don't lower yourselves to his level.

05:02.720 --> 05:03.519
Aunt,

05:04.360 --> 05:05.480
you don't need to mind them.

05:07.090 --> 05:08.860
What are you acting
all high and mighty for?

05:09.560 --> 05:10.759
"Great clans' interests?"

05:10.759 --> 05:11.759
"Must?"

05:11.760 --> 05:13.199
I've never even heard of such things.

05:13.639 --> 05:14.959
Now that you've spoken,

05:15.560 --> 05:17.680
I agreed, but you still won't drop it.

05:18.279 --> 05:19.079
Fine.

05:19.360 --> 05:20.439
I'm not giving

05:21.079 --> 05:22.720
those areas to you anymore.

05:22.959 --> 05:24.959
I want to see what you can do to me.

05:26.000 --> 05:26.439
This...

05:27.800 --> 05:28.600
Wei Hao,

05:28.800 --> 05:29.720
since that's the case,

05:29.720 --> 05:31.439
we won't negotiate with you.

05:31.439 --> 05:32.319
Then don't.

05:32.759 --> 05:33.360
Wait...

05:33.370 --> 05:34.880
You think your great clans
are that great?

05:34.959 --> 05:35.959
Don't push me.

05:35.959 --> 05:37.560
If you push me, within ten years,

05:37.560 --> 05:38.680
I'll wipe out your great clans.

05:38.680 --> 05:39.639
What are you posing for?

05:42.720 --> 05:44.560
Wipe out our great clans?

05:47.439 --> 05:49.439
You're quite the big shot, huh?

05:52.600 --> 05:55.279
I forgot you are now
a Lord of the current dynasty.

05:55.560 --> 05:56.480
Aside from

05:56.600 --> 05:58.720
Dukes, Commandery Dukes,
and County Dukes,

05:59.600 --> 06:01.300
Commandery Marquises,
and County Marquises,

06:03.199 --> 06:06.040
all that's left is you,
the Dynasty-Founding County Lord.

06:06.680 --> 06:08.319
Even without the title of Lord,

06:09.879 --> 06:12.000
I'll still take you down.

06:12.000 --> 06:14.199
Stop being a Lord anymore, then!

06:14.720 --> 06:17.120
How dare you say you
will strip our Lord title

06:17.120 --> 06:19.160
here in the Wei ancestral home?

06:19.399 --> 06:21.720
Is this the authority
your Clan Leader gave you?

06:23.240 --> 06:24.680
We can decide

06:24.920 --> 06:26.160
matters in the capital.

06:28.319 --> 06:29.639
Can you decide

06:29.680 --> 06:31.600
the relationship between the two clans?

06:33.519 --> 06:36.439
You actually dare to threaten me
with the relationship between our clans?

06:39.160 --> 06:40.950
The Clan Leader has
finally grown a backbone.

06:41.439 --> 06:42.240
Fine.

06:44.279 --> 06:45.079
Clan Leader Wei,

06:46.040 --> 06:47.160
since Wei Hao

06:47.759 --> 06:49.839
doesn't understand
the rules of our great clans,

06:50.000 --> 06:52.680
if you don't teach him,
someone else will.

06:55.199 --> 06:56.160
But Wei Hao,

06:58.199 --> 06:59.279
Lord Wei,

07:00.120 --> 07:01.439
I believe it won't be long

07:01.439 --> 07:02.759
before you come looking for us.

07:03.240 --> 07:05.759
At that time, it won't be
just 50 percent of the goods.

07:07.439 --> 07:09.319
You'll have to beg us

07:10.040 --> 07:12.800
to accept a 50 percent
share of your glaze workshop.

07:13.199 --> 07:14.879
I'll fix that mouth of yours first.

07:15.160 --> 07:15.439
Hao.

07:15.439 --> 07:15.959
Don't stop me.

07:15.959 --> 07:17.380
I've been sick of him for a long time.

07:17.399 --> 07:18.399
Are you even great clans?

07:18.399 --> 07:19.480
You're robbers.

07:19.519 --> 07:20.920
You think you're so great?

07:21.040 --> 07:22.560
This fool is out of his mind. Let's go.

07:22.560 --> 07:23.279
Don't run!

07:24.160 --> 07:25.639
Bring on whatever you've got!

07:25.639 --> 07:27.160
Do you think I was born yesterday?

07:27.360 --> 07:28.160
All right.

07:33.000 --> 07:33.800
Clan Leader,

07:34.319 --> 07:35.759
is there really such a rule?

07:35.759 --> 07:38.199
Does our workshop really
have to give them 50 percent?

07:38.319 --> 07:40.480
Fifty percent?
They're asking for too much.

07:40.720 --> 07:43.639
However, the great clans
do take a 30-percent share.

07:44.399 --> 07:45.519
Our Wei clan

07:45.680 --> 07:49.319
only has influence in the capital area.

07:49.720 --> 07:50.879
Once you leave the capital,

07:51.000 --> 07:52.160
we have none.

07:53.040 --> 07:56.439
The other great clans
are even more powerful.

07:56.720 --> 07:59.000
They control a large
number of officials.

07:59.920 --> 08:03.040
The number of Wei
clan sons in the imperial court

08:03.040 --> 08:05.800
is only about fifty or so.

08:06.319 --> 08:09.720
We simply cannot compare to them.

08:12.240 --> 08:13.040
Hao,

08:13.399 --> 08:14.040
let's

08:14.279 --> 08:16.160
just give them 30 percent.

08:16.160 --> 08:17.800
I'd rather close the glaze workshop

08:17.800 --> 08:19.040
than give it to them.

08:20.160 --> 08:22.839
The world doesn't just belong
to those few clans.

08:23.040 --> 08:24.560
They already control the court.

08:24.570 --> 08:26.590
Do they want to control
all the world's wealth too?

08:27.040 --> 08:28.279
Wei Hao,

08:28.639 --> 08:30.839
a Lord is nothing

08:31.000 --> 08:32.720
in their eyes.

08:33.160 --> 08:35.720
They have many ways to deal with you,

08:36.199 --> 08:38.839
like having His Majesty
strip you of your title.

08:39.120 --> 08:39.920
Even

08:40.160 --> 08:42.079
imprisonment is not impossible.

08:43.519 --> 08:44.839
I think

08:45.399 --> 08:49.959
petitions for your impeachment
will be sent up this afternoon.

08:51.759 --> 08:53.000
Impeaching me this afternoon,

08:53.759 --> 08:55.240
and they still want my goods?

08:56.240 --> 08:57.199
In their dreams.

08:59.720 --> 09:01.079
If they impeach me,

09:01.279 --> 09:02.160
as for my glaze,

09:02.160 --> 09:04.580
those great clans won't have
a chance to sell a single piece.

09:06.240 --> 09:07.759
I'd rather smash it all.

09:09.279 --> 09:09.879
I'm leaving.

09:12.240 --> 09:13.040
Hao.

09:16.220 --> 09:17.320
You still have an appetite?

09:19.799 --> 09:21.080
It looks like we won't be able

09:21.080 --> 09:22.200
to keep our glaze workshop.

09:22.559 --> 09:24.600
The great clans want to buy
a 50-percent share,

09:24.919 --> 09:26.720
and they said if I don't,
I'll be in for it.

09:27.020 --> 09:28.639
Who knows how many impeachment petitions

09:28.639 --> 09:29.960
have already reached His Majesty?

09:30.200 --> 09:32.759
The people from those great clans
have some nerve.

09:32.760 --> 09:34.279
How dare they try to steal our things!

09:34.519 --> 09:35.840
I just went to talk to them.

09:36.000 --> 09:38.240
If my aunt hadn't stopped me,
I would've beaten them up.

09:38.679 --> 09:39.519
They even said

09:40.000 --> 09:43.080
I'd eventually be begging
them to buy our shares.

09:43.799 --> 09:45.039
Arrogant, indeed.

09:45.600 --> 09:46.639
So darn arrogant.

09:46.960 --> 09:48.080
If they push me too far,

09:48.600 --> 09:49.799
within ten years,

09:49.799 --> 09:51.279
I'll wipe out those great clans.

09:51.960 --> 09:53.840
(The great clans are
a thorn in Father's side.)

09:54.559 --> 09:55.720
(But right now, Great Yong)

09:55.720 --> 09:57.159
(has no choice but to rely on them.)

09:57.679 --> 09:58.480
Fool,

09:59.159 --> 10:01.039
wipe out the great clans
within ten years?

10:01.050 --> 10:02.990
Do you even know what
the great clans represent?

10:03.159 --> 10:03.960
What's there to fear?

10:04.860 --> 10:06.879
Isn't it just that commoners
have no books to read?

10:07.080 --> 10:08.540
Doesn't the Imperial Family
have plenty of books?

10:08.559 --> 10:09.990
Give them to me, and I'll print them.

10:10.000 --> 10:12.190
I'll make sure everyone
in the world has books to read.

10:12.639 --> 10:13.440
Wei Hao,

10:13.720 --> 10:14.639
printing?

10:14.879 --> 10:16.720
Do you know how much printing costs?

10:16.730 --> 10:18.280
That's because they don't understand it.

10:21.039 --> 10:21.840
So now,

10:21.919 --> 10:22.960
what do we do?

10:24.159 --> 10:24.799
It's fine.

10:25.279 --> 10:25.919
Don't worry.

10:26.039 --> 10:26.759
I'll protect you.

10:26.759 --> 10:27.879
You'll protect me?

10:28.919 --> 10:31.200
You'd better help me figure out
how to find His Majesty

10:31.200 --> 10:32.639
and have him intervene for us.

10:34.759 --> 10:35.320
Girl,

10:35.519 --> 10:36.240
tell me,

10:36.440 --> 10:37.320
what if we

10:38.080 --> 10:40.360
give a 30-percent share to those Dukes?

10:40.600 --> 10:41.360
Would that work?

10:41.840 --> 10:42.960
With the Dukes involved,

10:43.050 --> 10:44.919
those great clans
wouldn't dare sue us, right?

10:45.120 --> 10:45.919
No.

10:46.220 --> 10:47.279
What do you mean by "no"?

10:47.840 --> 10:49.559
You stingy brat.

10:49.560 --> 10:50.879
With just me and
a penniless princess like you,

10:50.879 --> 10:52.190
how could we protect this fortune?

10:52.240 --> 10:53.039
Dream on.

10:53.159 --> 10:53.960
Do you know

10:54.120 --> 10:56.200
how much profit the glaze workshop
makes in a year?

10:56.519 --> 10:57.679
You dead fool.

10:57.840 --> 10:59.720
You're the stingy one, you cheapskate.

10:59.720 --> 11:01.200
You're going to be the death of me.

11:01.559 --> 11:02.720
Anyway, I'm not giving it.

11:02.840 --> 11:04.399
If you want to give, use your own share.

11:05.440 --> 11:06.240
Fine.

11:06.840 --> 11:07.759
Let's eat first.

11:07.760 --> 11:09.559
After dinner,
I'll go check the glaze workshop.

11:09.559 --> 11:10.240
And you?

11:10.240 --> 11:11.360
Try to find a way

11:11.360 --> 11:12.399
for me to see His Majesty.

11:12.399 --> 11:13.759
I really can't hold out much longer.

11:13.759 --> 11:14.559
Father,

11:14.559 --> 11:16.000
someone is bullying Wei the Fool.

11:16.000 --> 11:16.759
What do you mean?

11:18.159 --> 11:20.120
Regarding our imperial glaze workshop,

11:20.130 --> 11:21.990
the great clans want to
take a 50-percent stake.

11:22.200 --> 11:23.519
Wei the Fool didn't agree,

11:23.840 --> 11:25.799
so they threatened to send him to prison

11:25.800 --> 11:27.600
and told him he'd have
to beg them for mercy.

11:28.120 --> 11:28.919
Father,

11:29.159 --> 11:30.879
the great clans have gone too far.

11:31.000 --> 11:33.620
Not only do they want to rob Wei
Hao when they see him making money,

11:33.639 --> 11:35.840
but they're also getting
officials to impeach him.

11:36.000 --> 11:36.919
No wonder.

11:37.120 --> 11:40.320
I received many memorials
impeaching Wei Hao yesterday.

11:40.799 --> 11:41.600
Father,

11:41.679 --> 11:43.480
you must stand up for Wei the Fool.

11:43.480 --> 11:44.390
What is there to fear?

11:44.440 --> 11:46.360
So, they dare bully
someone under my protection?

11:46.440 --> 11:47.840
Just tell him to rest easy.

11:48.840 --> 11:50.799
But he's very worried right now.

11:51.480 --> 11:53.360
He'll likely go talk to the Dukes.

11:54.440 --> 11:56.200
Those great clans are far too arrogant.

11:56.200 --> 11:57.679
Can they not stand to
see anyone make a profit?

11:57.679 --> 11:58.960
What can be done?

12:00.120 --> 12:01.200
Those great clans

12:01.759 --> 12:03.639
are all tightly bound together.

12:03.639 --> 12:04.840
Who

12:04.879 --> 12:06.440
could compete with them?

12:08.240 --> 12:09.039
Father,

12:09.399 --> 12:10.360
Wei the Fool said

12:10.679 --> 12:12.159
that if given ten years,

12:12.960 --> 12:15.159
he would take down those great clans.

12:15.960 --> 12:18.799
He also mentioned
something about printing books.

12:18.879 --> 12:19.960
If we had books,

12:20.200 --> 12:22.960
it could shake the foundation
of the great clans.

12:23.120 --> 12:25.639
But is printing books really that easy?

12:25.639 --> 12:26.879
With woodblock printing,

12:27.000 --> 12:28.799
does he have any idea how much it costs?

12:28.960 --> 12:31.039
Does he know how many
blocks one book requires?

12:31.320 --> 12:31.639
Well...

12:31.759 --> 12:32.759
That brat...

12:32.759 --> 12:33.480
Father,

12:33.799 --> 12:35.720
I've said those same
things to him before,

12:35.840 --> 12:37.360
but he just asked what I know about it.

12:37.879 --> 12:39.759
Could he really have some sort of plan?

12:41.080 --> 12:43.159
I'll have to ask him properly
another day.

12:43.159 --> 12:44.080
No need.

12:44.159 --> 12:45.159
There's no way.

12:45.559 --> 12:46.360
Your Majesty,

12:46.799 --> 12:49.519
the great clans acting this way
is not a good sign.

12:51.240 --> 12:52.360
I am aware.

12:53.279 --> 12:55.480
But what can be done?

12:55.720 --> 12:57.039
If I killed them all,

12:57.080 --> 12:59.480
who would help me govern the world?

12:59.799 --> 13:00.879
I believe

13:00.879 --> 13:02.440
Wei Hao does have a way.

13:04.519 --> 13:07.480
Your Majesty might consider
summoning him for a detailed talk.

13:10.600 --> 13:11.840
Have him come to the palace?

13:12.639 --> 13:13.799
I feel

13:13.799 --> 13:16.360
that Wei Hao is indeed
a guy with some ability.

13:16.639 --> 13:18.960
It would be beneficial for
Your Majesty to see him.

13:19.080 --> 13:19.840
Fine.

13:19.840 --> 13:21.320
Let's meet, then.

13:21.330 --> 13:24.360
It'll keep him from getting so scared
that he starts running to the Dukes.

13:25.799 --> 13:28.330
The day after tomorrow,
have the Ministry of Rites notify him.

13:29.480 --> 13:30.600
Those great clans

13:31.080 --> 13:33.519
all want me to deal with Wei the Fool.

13:34.559 --> 13:35.919
In their dreams.

13:36.600 --> 13:38.879
I support Wei the Fool.

13:47.075 --> 13:49.905
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

13:50.525 --> 13:53.925
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

13:54.695 --> 13:57.645
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

13:57.985 --> 14:00.685
♪Sigh and walk away♪

14:02.285 --> 14:05.755
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

14:05.755 --> 14:07.985
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

14:07.985 --> 14:10.095
♪Colors and darkness♪

14:10.095 --> 14:12.115
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

14:12.115 --> 14:16.475
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

14:17.915 --> 14:21.645
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

14:21.915 --> 14:25.515
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

14:25.675 --> 14:27.755
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

14:27.755 --> 14:32.545
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

14:32.765 --> 14:34.385
♪The world mistakes me♪

14:34.385 --> 14:36.725
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

14:36.795 --> 14:37.985
♪As the storm approaches♪

14:37.985 --> 14:40.385
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

14:40.595 --> 14:42.315
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

14:42.315 --> 14:44.295
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

14:44.465 --> 14:46.215
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

14:46.215 --> 14:48.315
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

14:48.315 --> 14:49.785
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

14:49.785 --> 14:52.015
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

14:52.235 --> 14:53.435
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

14:53.435 --> 14:55.955
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

14:56.085 --> 14:57.795
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

14:57.795 --> 14:59.075
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

14:59.225 --> 15:00.645
♪My wish has finally come true♪

15:00.645 --> 15:01.685
♪To stay by your side♪

15:01.685 --> 15:03.605
♪In this fleeting world♪

15:03.775 --> 15:07.025
♪We are free and happy♪

15:11.025 --> 15:12.805
♪From a nobody♪

15:12.805 --> 15:14.705
♪To someone now famous♪

15:14.815 --> 15:16.245
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

15:16.245 --> 15:18.755
♪But I laugh at how they
cannot see through it all♪

15:18.855 --> 15:20.435
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

15:20.435 --> 15:22.505
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

15:22.715 --> 15:24.395
♪In this vast world♪

15:24.395 --> 15:26.395
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

15:26.545 --> 15:28.755
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

15:28.755 --> 15:30.345
♪Everything ends eventually♪

15:30.435 --> 15:31.935
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

15:31.935 --> 15:34.335
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

15:34.335 --> 15:36.045
♪No matter how time flies♪

15:36.045 --> 15:37.205
♪Even if the falling snow♪

15:37.205 --> 15:38.835
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

15:38.835 --> 15:39.875
♪All I want now♪

15:39.875 --> 15:41.975
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

15:41.975 --> 15:45.235
♪Year after year♪
